/div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Age getting to ya Isator?<br /> <br /> If it makes you feel better I'm trying to come to terms with being a quarter of a century old.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T22:35:08-07:00","id":1083856,"title":"","content":"This soundtrack by the way is perfect for Exalted play. I just wish it was on Spotify! Next paycheck I am just going to purchase it on itunes so I can play it during game. I played it during a major combat (via youtube) during the Exalted game I play in on Sundays and I was able to whip out all kinds of epic 2 and 3 die stunts! I was so inspired. ^_^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T01:13:38-07:00","id":1083890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Keichiokami</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/951376-exalted-related-media-thunderbolt-fantasy-aka-exalted-the-tv-show?p=1083856#post1083856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This soundtrack by the way is perfect for Exalted play. I just wish it was on Spotify! Next paycheck I am just going to purchase it on itunes so I can play it during game. I played it during a major combat (via youtube) during the Exalted game I play in on Sundays and I was able to whip out all kinds of epic 2 and 3 die stunts! I was so inspired. ^_^</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you for the implicit suggestion to add it to my Exalted playlists. YOUTUBE AWAAAAAAYYYYYY!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T20:24:50-07:00","id":1084289,"title":"","content":"Thank you all for reviving this thread. TF has been on my to-watch list forever, but thanks to this, I finally took the time to watch the first episode earlier. It really is good, and I adjusted to watching the puppets faster than I thought I would. If my players ask for examples of what Charm usage looks like from an outside perspective, I am def showing them this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5574-volatilesublime","name":"VolatileSublime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5574_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T21:06:15-07:00","id":1084313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VolatileSublime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/951376-exalted-related-media-thunderbolt-fantasy-aka-exalted-the-tv-show?p=1084289#post1084289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you all for reviving this thread. TF has been on my to-watch list forever, but thanks to this, I finally took the time to watch the first episode earlier. It really is good, and I adjusted to watching the puppets faster than I thought I would. If my players ask for examples of what Charm usage looks like from an outside perspective, I am def showing them this.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You really forget that they're puppets after a little while. You really do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T19:10:37-07:00","id":1086000,"title":"","content":"Anybody have any good ideas for a martial arts charm tree inspired by the secrets of Sh\u0101ng B\u00f9 Hu\u00e0n's style? Because this thread made me marathon the show over like 2 days and now I wanna include him as an NPC in a game lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12584-spacenerd5792","name":"spacenerd5792","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T00:38:55-07:00","id":1086095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>spacenerd5792</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/951376-exalted-related-media-thunderbolt-fantasy-aka-exalted-the-tv-show?p=1086000#post1086000\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anybody have any good ideas for a martial arts charm tree inspired by the secrets of Sh\u0101ng B\u00f9 Hu\u00e0n's style? Because this thread made me marathon the show over like 2 days and now I wanna include him as an NPC in a game lol.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That is a good question. I would say his style is not Martial Arts but a manifestation of the Solar Melee tree.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T12:03:31-07:00","id":1086279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Keichiokami</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/951376-exalted-related-media-thunderbolt-fantasy-aka-exalted-the-tv-show?p=1086095#post1086095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That is a good question. I would say his style is not Martial Arts but a manifestation of the Solar Melee tree.</div> </div> </div> </div>Possibly. I realize that with Solar Melee you can actually get better for cheaper effects (Glorious Solar Saber for instance), but what I'm looking for/wanting to emulate is not JUST being capable of cutting enemies and such with only a wooden sword or stick, but also mimicking the philosophy behind, making it exhausting and more work than it's worth as a matter of point, probably represented by Willpower and Essence expenditures in the extreme. If we could also finagle it so that somehow the essence is channeled through his &quot;sword&quot; instead of into the air to avoid lighting up like the 4th of July with the levels of Essence use I'd like to be involved, that'd be icing on the cake. Maybe I should bring it up in the ask the devs thread?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12584-spacenerd5792","name":"spacenerd5792","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T21:27:07-07:00","id":1086459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>spacenerd5792</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/951376-exalted-related-media-thunderbolt-fantasy-aka-exalted-the-tv-show?p=1086279#post1086279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Possibly. I realize that with Solar Melee you can actually get better for cheaper effects (Glorious Solar Saber for instance), but what I'm looking for/wanting to emulate is not JUST being capable of cutting enemies and such with only a wooden sword or stick, but also mimicking the philosophy behind, making it exhausting and more work than it's worth as a matter of point, probably represented by Willpower and Essence expenditures in the extreme. If we could also finagle it so that somehow the essence is channeled through his &quot;sword&quot; instead of into the air to avoid lighting up like the 4th of July with the levels of Essence use I'd like to be involved, that'd be icing on the cake. Maybe I should bring it up in the ask the devs thread?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I mean honestly that can be replicated by simply having the character focus on spending personal essence to activate his charms. Also Single Point Shining Into the Void could work, or Steel Devil Style. A combination of those two styles and melee charms could work. Just keep in mind that Exalted charms, particularly Solar ones tend to make one a superlative expert, creating a sense of effortlessness in whatever ability the character chooses to specialize in, so replicating that philosophy in the EX3 system is going to be difficult at best and unfitting at worst.<br /> <br /> If it is for an NPC it maybe best to simply have the visual stylings and thematics of Edgeless Blade to excite and interest your players. Are your players the type to say &quot;oh wow how is he doing that? I want to learn that!&quot; ? Is that why you are trying to replicate his style mechanically?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T02:12:43-07:00","id":1086525,"title":"","content":"Edgeless Blade is Brawl Supernal, imho.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T15:29:33-07:00","id":1088518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elkovash</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/951376-exalted-related-media-thunderbolt-fantasy-aka-exalted-the-tv-show?p=1086525#post1086525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edgeless Blade is Brawl Supernal, imho.</div> </div> </div> </div>Totally. Treat the bokken as an improvised weapon. <br /> <br /> Although, the reveal in the final episode indicates he is also skilled in Melee and just prefers not to be that flashy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11690-mizzlfoshizzl","name":"mizzlfoshizzl",