e a case of being attuned and using evocations rather than charms. Maybe he's got lore charms too? :P<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Rereading thanks to the best kind of thread-cro-mancy (so excite for the film!!)<br /> <br /> ... what if he's Supernal Lore, and the punching someone's rib cage out is his stunt for Injury-Forcing Technique?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11690-mizzlfoshizzl","name":"mizzlfoshizzl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11690_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:19:22-08:00","id":1159034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Keichiokami</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/951376-exalted-related-media-thunderbolt-fantasy-aka-exalted-the-tv-show?p=1158828#post1158828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The prequel/Sequel film is releasing next month! Half of the film is a side story about Screaming Phoenix Killer's past and the second half is about the events between S1 and S2! I am so excited!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/AImWnxx8IZQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/AImWnxx8IZQ</a></div> </div> </div> </div>THE LAND IS CLAD IN DEEPEST BLUE...<br /> SHADOWS OF EAGLES ACROSS THE MOON....<br /> <br /> Errh... yeah. I'm excited too :E","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>__________________________________________________ </b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b><i>Preaching the enlightened gospels of Gaming Anarchy</i></b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/225-growls","name":"Growls","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T13:22:06-08:00","id":1159538,"title":"","content":"For him to collect so many ten thousand year daiklaves, and knowing how to activate them, I think he's spending a ton of exp buying the evocations, or spent the time to learn and unlock the evocations for free.<br /> <br /> Either way, plenty of Lore charms to back that up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21242-charonferryman","name":"CharonFerryman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21242_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-25T23:25:21-08:00","id":1189539,"title":"","content":"So I'm just gonna do some necromancy here. The movie is on Crunchyroll now and I just watched it today. It was really good, honestly I love the explanation on the Sword Saint Tournament evolving into the Sword Hero Tournament because the current holder of the title seems unbeatable. Definitely seems like a fun bit of flavor to add to a tournament for players regardless of whether or not someone decided to make the Sword Saint an exalt.<br /> <br /> A more specific bit to that part of the story.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Dear god do you feel bad for Screaming Pheonix Killer by the end of it. I mean it very quickly transitions from the origin of Screaming Pheonix Killer as an entity of infamy and terror into a story that would very much like to remind everyone that the Engimatic Gale is a dick. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-26T18:46:20-08:00","id":1189740,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/951376-exalted-related-media-thunderbolt-fantasy-aka-exalted-the-tv-show?p=1189539#post1189539\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm just gonna do some necromancy here. The movie is on Crunchyroll now and I just watched it today. It was really good, honestly I love the explanation on the Sword Saint Tournament evolving into the Sword Hero Tournament because the current holder of the title seems unbeatable. Definitely seems like a fun bit of flavor to add to a tournament for players regardless of whether or not someone decided to make the Sword Saint an exalt.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh.<br /> Well then.<br /> I know something I'm doing Saturday.<br /> (cause work and sleep won't let me watch it till then most likely...)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-05T05:55:30-08:00","id":1191902,"title":"","content":"I don't think it's a spoiler to say I laughed myself hoarse for the chubby-cheeks guy's story telling. <br /> <br /> *thumbs-up hand-jive*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon